# Blow the Man Down: traditional sea shanty, text after 19th-century versions (Whall 1910).
{title: Blow the Man Down}
{composer: Traditional (sea shanty)}
{key: G}
{tempo: 132}
{time: 3/4}
{x_level: 1}
{x_strum: D - D - D -}

{comment: One down per beat to start; later try D - D U D U.}

{start_of_grid label="Verse"}
| G . . | G . . |
| G . . | D . . |
